//   when the requested symbol is absent.  Because make_unbound_value()
//   uses a function-local static, the address is stable across all
//   translation units: every module-level `static SEXP R_UnboundValue`
//   points to the same SEXPREC.  The Python callback registered via
//   register_findVarInFrame_fn() must return get_R_UnboundValue() to
//   reproduce the same pointer on the failure path.
